[39m  [38;5;246mnow, tedious to retrofit.[39m
  [38;5;246m3.[39m [ ] End-to-end tests
  [38;5;246mPlaywright against the built app. Real value once there's UI worth regression-testing, but meaningful setup cost for a
[39m  [38;5;246mone-page app.[39m
  [38;5;246m4.[39m [ ] Bare minimum
  [38;5;246mJust Vite and TypeScript defaults. Fastest to first code, and we add tooling when it hurts. Select alone.[39m
